00:10:43,691 --> 00:10:46,559
to about eleven thousand dollars an ounce

280
00:10:46,559 --> 00:10:48,447
in March twenty twenty-six,

281
00:10:48,447 --> 00:10:50,756
still far below its peak of about

282
00:10:50,756 --> 00:10:53,344
thirty thousand in twenty twenty-one.

283
00:10:53,524 --> 00:10:56,885
Thieves sell standard converters for about twenty-five

284
00:10:56,885 --> 00:10:58,440
to three hundred dollars,

285
00:10:58,440 --> 00:11:00,619
and hybrid converters for up to one

286
00:11:00,619 --> 00:11:01,988
thousand four hundred.

287
00:11:02,168 --> 00:11:03,138
For the owner,

288
00:11:03,138 --> 00:11:05,979
replacement can cost up to three thousand

289
00:11:05,979 --> 00:11:06,533
dollars.

290
00:11:06,883 --> 00:11:08,647
And then there are tailgates.

291
00:11:08,827 --> 00:11:10,615
In twenty twenty-four,

292
00:11:10,615 --> 00:11:12,322
police in Costa Mesa,

293
00:11:12,322 --> 00:11:16,548
California, counted at least twenty pickup tailgates

294
00:11:16,548 --> 00:11:18,742
stolen over several months,

295
00:11:18,742 --> 00:11:21,749
nineteen of them from Toyota Tacomas,

296
00:11:21,749 --> 00:11:23,618
according to ABC seven.

297
00:11:23,798 --> 00:11:24,837
In one case,

298
00:11:24,837 --> 00:11:28,040
a tailgate was removed in under sixty

299
00:11:28,040 --> 00:11:28,733
seconds.

300
00:11:28,913 --> 00:11:31,752
A local body shop estimated two thousand

301
00:11:31,752 --> 00:11:34,734
five hundred to four thousand five hundred

302
00:11:34,734 --> 00:11:36,083
dollars to repaint,

303
00:11:36,083 --> 00:11:38,781
install and recalibrate a replacement.

304
00:11:39,131 --> 00:11:40,640
Here is the twist.

305
00:11:40,820 --> 00:11:44,349
Tailgates got expensive because trucks got smarter.

306
00:11:44,529 --> 00:11:47,292
A modern tailgate can carry a backup

307
00:11:47,292 --> 00:11:49,365
camera, sensors and wiring,

308
00:11:49,365 --> 00:11:52,819
which is why replacement needs recalibration.

309
00:11:52,999 --> 00:11:56,263
The same shop owner said newer Chevrolets

310
00:11:56,263 --> 00:11:59,050
and F-150s were being hit for parts

311
00:11:59,050 --> 00:12:02,554
like cameras, door handles and assist steps.

312
00:12:02,734 --> 00:12:05,225
The features that make trucks nicer also

313
00:12:05,225 --> 00:12:06,844
make them worth stripping.

314
00:12:07,194 --> 00:12:08,726
Where does it happen most?

315
00:12:08,906 --> 00:12:12,321
According to an analysis by AmericanTrucks,

316
00:12:12,321 --> 00:12:15,021
based on FBI crime data and Census

317
00:12:15,021 --> 00:12:18,912
population estimates, the cities with the highest

318
00:12:18,912 --> 00:12:22,565
theft rates per one hundred thousand residents

319
00:12:22,565 --> 00:12:24,550
were Oakland, California,

320
00:12:24,550 --> 00:12:24,788
St.

321
00:12:24,968 --> 00:12:27,614
Louis, Minneapolis, Dayton,

322
00:12:27,614 --> 00:12:29,868
Ohio, and Philadelphia.

323
00:12:30,048 --> 00:12:32,743
By state, the highest rates were in

324
00:12:32,743 --> 00:12:33,821
Washington, D.

325
00:12:34,001 --> 00:12:34,257
C.

326
00:12:34,437 --> 00:12:36,203
, Nevada, California,

327
00:12:36,203 --> 00:12:38,221
Maryland and New Mexico.

328
00:12:38,572 --> 00:12:42,648
California alone accounted for about twenty-one percent

329
00:12:42,648 --> 00:12:43,018
of U.

330
00:12:43,198 --> 00:12:43,581
S.

331
00:12:43,761 --> 00:12:47,579
vehicle thefts, about one hundred thirty-seven thousand

332
00:12:47,579 --> 00:12:50,425
vehicles, according to the same analysis.

333
00:12:50,605 --> 00:12:52,208
But here is the twist.

334
00:12:52,388 --> 00:12:55,025
California also had the biggest drop,

335
00:12:55,025 --> 00:12:56,807
with forty-five thousand,

336
00:12:56,807 --> 00:13:00,229
two hundred seventy-eight fewer thefts in twenty

337
00:13:00,229 --> 00:13:03,437
twenty-five, according to NICB as reported by

338
00:13:03,437 --> 00:13:04,079
The Shop.

339
00:13:04,259 --> 00:13:07,137
Texas had twenty-three thousand fewer,

340
00:13:07,137 --> 00:13:10,923
and Washington state almost twelve thousand fewer.

341
00:13:11,103 --> 00:13:13,635
The places with the worst problems are

342
00:13:13,635 --> 00:13:15,433
also improving the fastest.

343
00:13:15,784 --> 00:13:18,681
NICB's own metro ranking tells a similar

344
00:13:18,681 --> 00:13:19,116
story.

345
00:13:19,296 --> 00:13:20,533
By total thefts,

346
00:13:20,533 --> 00:13:23,702
the Los Angeles area led with fifty-three

347
00:13:23,702 --> 00:13:26,021
thousand, nine hundred eleven,

348
00:13:26,021 --> 00:13:29,732
followed by New York with twenty-seven thousand,

349
00:13:29,732 --> 00:13:31,665
one hundred thirty-eight,

350
00:13:31,665 --> 00:13:34,989
Chicago, Houston, and the San Francisco Bay

351
00:13:34,989 --> 00:13:35,375
Area.

352
00:13:35,555 --> 00:13:37,726
More than one-third of all U.

353
00:13:37,906 --> 00:13:38,243
S.

354
00:13:38,423 --> 00:13:40,697
thefts happened in just the top ten

355
00:13:40,697 --> 00:13:41,477
metro areas.

356
00:13:41,657 --> 00:13:43,663
By rate, among large metros,

357
00:13:43,663 --> 00:13:46,672
San Francisco and Oakland had the highest,

358
00:13:46,672 --> 00:13:50,111
about four hundred seventy-eight per one hundred

359
00:13:50,111 --> 00:13:53,407
thousand people, almost tied with Bakersfield,

360
00:13:53,407 --> 00:13:54,195
California.

361
00:13:54,546 --> 00:13:56,310
And here is a twist on the

362
00:13:56,310 --> 00:13:56,717
twist.

363
00:13:56,897 --> 00:14:00,515
Memphis, Tennessee, previously had the worst metro

364
00:14:00,515 --> 00:14:02,397
theft rate in the country,

365
00:14:02,397 --> 00:14:04,640
and dropped out of first place.

366
00:14:04,820 --> 00:14:08,764
Washington state saw the biggest percentage drop

367
00:14:08,764 --> 00:14:09,832
of any state,

368
00:14:09,832 --> 00:14:14,515
thirty-nine percent, followed by Colorado at thirty-five.

369
00:14:14,695 --> 00:14:17,358
Texas still had seventy-five thousand,

370
00:14:17,358 --> 00:14:19,461
two hundred sixty-nine thefts,

371
00:14:19,461 --> 00:14:22,264
the second highest total in the country.

372
00:14:22,615 --> 00:14:25,296
One caution about city rankings.

373
00:14:25,476 --> 00:14:28,442
The same analysis notes that some cities

374
00:14:28,442 --> 00:14:31,482
in Texas, Florida and California may show

375
00:14:31,482 --> 00:14:34,744
low rates because of incomplete reporting to

376
00:14:34,744 --> 00:14:35,856
the FBI system,

377
00:14:35,856 --> 00:14:38,896
and it excluded Florida from state trends

378
00:14:38,896 --> 00:14:40,082
for that reason.

379
00:14:40,262 --> 00:14:42,255
So if your city does not appear

380
00:14:42,255 --> 00:14:42,899
on a list,

381
00:14:42,899 --> 00:14:44,828
it does not mean your truck is

382
00:14:44,828 --> 00:14:45,150
safe.

383
00:14:45,330 --> 00:14:47,380
It may only mean the data is

384
00:14:47,380 --> 00:14:48,186
incomplete.

385
00:14:48,536 --> 00:14:52,146
First, understand how modern trucks get stolen.

386
00:14:52,326 --> 00:14:56,703
Security company Compustar describes three common methods.

387
00:14:56,883 --> 00:14:58,202
In a relay attack,

388
00:14:58,202 --> 00:15:01,499
thieves use electronic devices to amplify the

389
00:15:01,499 --> 00:15:03,111
signal from a key fob,

390
00:15:03,111 --> 00:15:06,188
even one sitting inside the owner's house,

391
00:15:06,188 --> 00:15:08,387
so the truck thinks the key is

392
00:15:08,387 --> 00:15:08,899
nearby.

393
00:15:09,079 --> 00:15:10,549
In key programming,

394
00:15:10,549 --> 00:15:13,721
a device plugged into the diagnostic port

395
00:15:13,721 --> 00:15:16,893
under the dashboard programs a blank fob.

396
00:15:17,073 --> 00:15:18,687
And in a CAN bus attack,

397
00:15:18,687 --> 00:15:22,185
thieves reach the vehicle's internal network through

398
00:15:22,185 --> 00:15:24,471
wiring, such as behind a headlamp,

399
00:15:24,471 --> 00:15:26,825
and command it to unlock and start.

400
00:15:27,176 --> 00:15:28,557
Here is the twist.

401
00:15:28,737 --> 00:15:31,235
None of those methods needs a broken

402
00:15:31,235 --> 00:15:31,721
window.

403
00:15:31,901 --> 00:15:34,179
A truck can be gone in minutes,

404
00:15:34,179 --> 00:15:36,458
with no glass on the ground and

405
00:15:36,458 --> 00:15:39,324
no alarm, which is why owners sometimes

406
00:15:39,324 --> 00:15:40,794
assume it was towed.

407
00:15:40,974 --> 00:15:43,881
That is also why the newest defenses

408
00:15:43,881 --> 00:15:46,222
are software, not just locks.

409
00:15:46,572 --> 00:15:48,685
So what actually works?

410
00:15:48,865 --> 00:15:51,817
The manufacturers are finally fighting back with

411
00:15:51,817 --> 00:15:52,371
software.

412
00:15:52,551 --> 00:15:56,244
Ford introduced a feature called Start Inhibit

413
00:15:56,244 --> 00:15:58,974
with the twenty twenty-four F-150,

414
00:15:58,974 --> 00:16:02,267
and extended it to the twenty twenty-five

415
00:16:02,267 --> 00:16:05,960
Super Duty, according to the Associated Press.

416
00:16:06,140 --> 00:16:07,793
From the FordPass app,

417
00:16:07,793 --> 00:16:10,198
an owner can disable the engine,

418
00:16:10,198 --> 00:16:12,603
so the truck will not start even

419
00:16:12,603 --> 00:16:14,256
with a key fob inside.

420
00:16:14,436 --> 00:16:16,446
Ford planned to add it to more

421
00:16:16,446 --> 00:16:18,522
vehicles for twenty twenty-six.

422
00:16:18,873 --> 00:16:22,369
The system also sends smartphone alerts if

423
00:16:22,369 --> 00:16:24,450
someone enters the truck,

424
00:16:24,450 --> 00:16:25,532
opens a door,

425
00:16:25,532 --> 00:16:27,197
or moves or tows it.

426
00:16:27,377 --> 00:16:29,844
It is included for one year after

427
00:16:29,844 --> 00:16:33,581
activation, then costs seven dollars ninety-nine a

428
00:16:33,581 --> 00:16:34,029
month.

429
00:16:34,209 --> 00:16:36,451
And after a theft is reported,

430
00:16:36,451 --> 00:16:39,066
a Ford call center confirms it with

431
00:16:39,066 --> 00:16:41,532
police and works with them to use

432
00:16:41,532 --> 00:16:44,148
Start Inhibit and locate the truck.

433
00:16:44,328 --> 00:16:47,582
Detroit police aim to recover vehicles within

434
00:16:47,582 --> 00:16:48,595
about an hour,

435
00:16:48,595 --> 00:16:50,620
while they are still intact.

436
00:16:50,971 --> 00:16:53,460
Here is the twist from the HLDI

437
00:16:53,460 --> 00:16:53,861
data.

438
00:16:54,041 --> 00:16:57,862
The least stolen vehicles were mostly electric

439
00:16:57,862 --> 00:16:59,440
and plug-in models,

440
00:16:59,440 --> 00:17:01,683
Teslas, the Mustang Mach-E,

441
00:17:01,683 --> 00:17:03,593
the Volkswagen ID four,

442
00:17:03,593 --> 00:17:04,839
the Kia EV six.

443
00:17:05,019 --> 00:17:06,998
According to GM Authority,

444
00:17:06,998 --> 00:17:10,273
the study attributed that partly to plug-in

445
00:17:10,273 --> 00:17:13,090
vehicles often being kept in garages,

446
00:17:13,090 --> 00:17:16,212
or being highly visible while charging in

447
00:17:16,212 --> 00:17:16,745
public.

448
00:17:16,925 --> 00:17:17,881
In other words,

449
00:17:17,881 --> 00:17:19,985
where you park matters as much as

450
00:17:19,985 --> 00:17:20,942
what you drive.

451
00:17:21,292 --> 00:17:23,214
So here is what you can do

452
00:17:23,214 --> 00:17:24,101
as an owner.

453
00:17:24,281 --> 00:17:26,239
Never leave the key fob in the

454
00:17:26,239 --> 00:17:27,544
truck, even at home.

455
00:17:27,724 --> 00:17:30,676
Park in a garage or a well-lit,

456
00:17:30,676 --> 00:17:31,915
visible spot.

457
00:17:32,095 --> 00:17:34,396
Lock the tailgate if your truck has

458
00:17:34,396 --> 00:17:36,763
a lock, and consider a tailgate lock

459
00:17:36,763 --> 00:17:37,749
if it does not.

460
00:17:37,929 --> 00:17:40,496
Ask a muffler shop about a catalytic

461
00:17:40,496 --> 00:17:43,777
converter shield or marking the converter with

462
00:17:43,777 --> 00:17:44,419
your VIN.

463
00:17:44,599 --> 00:17:47,474
Turn on any connected-app alerts your truck

464
00:17:47,474 --> 00:17:47,942
offers.

465
00:17:48,122 --> 00:17:50,601
And keep valuable tools out of the

466
00:17:50,601 --> 00:17:51,257
open bed.

467
00:17:51,608 --> 00:17:54,231
NICB adds its own basic tips.

468
00:17:54,411 --> 00:17:55,920
Park in well-lit areas,

469
00:17:55,920 --> 00:17:57,231
roll up the windows,

470
00:17:57,231 --> 00:17:58,215
lock the doors,

471
00:17:58,215 --> 00:18:01,100
never leave a running vehicle unattended and

472
00:18:01,100 --> 00:18:02,608
take the keys with you.

473
00:18:02,788 --> 00:18:06,026
And it suggests layers of protection,

474
00:18:06,026 --> 00:18:08,389
like a steering wheel lock,

475
00:18:08,389 --> 00:18:10,840
an alarm, a kill switch or a

476
00:18:10,840 --> 00:18:11,890
GPS tracker.

477
00:18:12,070 --> 00:18:14,509
A visible steering wheel lock will not

478
00:18:14,509 --> 00:18:16,498
stop a determined professional,

479
00:18:16,498 --> 00:18:18,680
but it makes your truck slower and

480
00:18:18,680 --> 00:18:20,861
more obvious to steal than the one

481
00:18:20,861 --> 00:18:21,567
next to it.

482
00:18:21,918 --> 00:18:23,555
And check your insurance.

483
00:18:23,735 --> 00:18:27,082
A catalytic converter or a tailgate theft

484
00:18:27,082 --> 00:18:31,165
is usually covered only by comprehensive coverage.

485
00:18:31,345 --> 00:18:34,386
Carfax noted that replacement can reach three

486
00:18:34,386 --> 00:18:38,576
thousand dollars, especially for drivers without comprehensive

487
00:18:38,576 --> 00:18:39,251
insurance.

488
00:18:39,431 --> 00:18:41,646
For a truck that thieves love,

489
00:18:41,646 --> 00:18:45,190
comprehensive coverage is not an optional extra.

490
00:18:45,370 --> 00:18:47,138
It is part of the cost of

491
00:18:47,138 --> 00:18:48,412
owning that truck.

492
00:18:48,762 --> 00:18:51,269
Now the warning for used truck buyers.

493
00:18:51,449 --> 00:18:54,740
Remember that most thefts are now professional,

494
00:18:54,740 --> 00:18:57,541
and vehicles are often stolen for resale

495
00:18:57,541 --> 00:19:00,482
with their identification numbers changed.

496
00:19:00,662 --> 00:19:03,324
That means some of those stolen trucks

497
00:19:03,324 --> 00:19:04,444
end up for sale,

498
00:19:04,444 --> 00:19:07,456
sometimes online, sometimes at a price that

499
00:19:07,456 --> 00:19:09,137
looks like a great deal.

500
00:19:09,317 --> 00:19:11,322
And if a truck you bought turns

501
00:19:11,322 --> 00:19:12,421
out to be stolen,

502
00:19:12,421 --> 00:19:14,038
it can be taken from you,

503
00:19:14,038 --> 00:19:15,784
and your money may be gone.

504
00:19:16,134 --> 00:19:18,741
So check the VIN in more than

505
00:19:18,741 --> 00:19:19,640
one place.

506
00:19:19,820 --> 00:19:21,777
The number on the dashboard,

507
00:19:21,777 --> 00:19:24,433
the sticker in the driver's door jamb,

508
00:19:24,433 --> 00:19:26,600
and the title should all match.

509
00:19:26,780 --> 00:19:29,269
NICB offers a free VIN check that

510
00:19:29,269 --> 00:19:32,362
shows whether a vehicle has been reported

511
00:19:32,362 --> 00:19:34,247
stolen and not recovered,

512
00:19:34,247 --> 00:19:36,887
or reported as a salvage vehicle by

513
00:19:36,887 --> 00:19:38,622
participating insurers.

514
00:19:38,802 --> 00:19:41,347
And a vehicle history report can show

515
00:19:41,347 --> 00:19:42,378
title problems.

516
00:19:42,558 --> 00:19:45,159
If a seller cannot produce a clean

517
00:19:45,159 --> 00:19:46,994
title in their own name,

518
00:19:46,994 --> 00:19:47,759
walk away.

519
00:19:48,110 --> 00:19:50,680
So which trucks are the most stolen

520
00:19:50,680 --> 00:19:51,488
in America?

521
00:19:51,668 --> 00:19:54,967
By count, the Chevrolet Silverado and the

522
00:19:54,967 --> 00:19:57,944
Ford F-150, because there are so many

523
00:19:57,944 --> 00:19:58,588
of them.

524
00:19:58,768 --> 00:20:00,184
By risk per truck,

525
00:20:00,184 --> 00:20:02,703
heavy-duty crew cab GMC Sierras,

526
00:20:02,703 --> 00:20:05,772
followed by the Ram fifteen hundred and

527
00:20:05,772 --> 00:20:07,661
Ram thirty-five hundred.

528
00:20:07,841 --> 00:20:08,999
And by parts,

529
00:20:08,999 --> 00:20:12,563
the F-150, the Ram heavy-duty trucks and

530
00:20:12,563 --> 00:20:16,484
the Silverado lead for catalytic converters,

531
00:20:16,484 --> 00:20:19,068
while Tacomas lose tailgates.

532
00:20:19,418 --> 00:20:20,811
And the final twist.

533
00:20:20,991 --> 00:20:23,069
The truck thieves want most is not

534
00:20:23,069 --> 00:20:24,903
always the most popular truck.

535
00:20:25,083 --> 00:20:27,016
It is the most valuable one,

536
00:20:27,016 --> 00:20:28,466
in the easiest place,

537
00:20:28,466 --> 00:20:30,192
with the fewest defenses.

538
00:20:30,372 --> 00:20:34,239
Theft dropped twenty-three percent in twenty twenty-five,

539
00:20:34,239 --> 00:20:37,359
which proves that better technology and better

540
00:20:37,359 --> 00:20:38,174
habits work.

541
00:20:38,354 --> 00:20:40,104
Your job is to make your truck

542
00:20:40,104 --> 00:20:42,147
a harder target than the one parked

543
00:20:42,147 --> 00:20:42,789
next to it.

544
00:20:43,139 --> 00:20:46,038
We put the anti-theft checklist and the

545
00:20:46,038 --> 00:20:48,789
used truck VIN checks into the Twenty

546
00:20:48,789 --> 00:20:51,242
Twenty-Seven Truck Buyer's Guide.

547
00:20:51,422 --> 00:20:53,558
The link is in the description and

548
00:20:53,558 --> 00:20:54,940
in the pinned comment.

549
00:20:55,120 --> 00:20:56,180
If this helped,

550
00:20:56,180 --> 00:20:59,005
subscribe, because next we look at every

551
00:20:59,005 --> 00:21:01,831
new truck coming in twenty twenty-seven.

552
00:21:02,011 --> 00:21:04,026
And tell us in the comments,

553
00:21:04,026 --> 00:21:05,105
has your truck,

554
00:21:05,105 --> 00:21:08,415
your tailgate or your catalytic converter ever

555
00:21:08,415 --> 00:21:09,279
been stolen?

556
00:21:09,459 --> 00:21:10,620
Thanks for watching.
